                        "entry_id": "50973dca-cfb1-3c0b-bbe7-6938a6604dcb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A 4-aminoquinoline drug used to treat and prevent malaria, having the chemical formula C₁₈H₂₆ClN₃."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
